          "jcr:created": "Fri Feb 02 2024 14:01:05 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Bedside stands at a glance</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Durable yet elegant, Stryker's bedside stands are designed to meet the demanding needs of today’s clinical environment. With five unique styles and a variety of laminate and hardware options, these bedside stands provide design latitude to coordinate your patient suites.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Concealed 1.5&quot; (4 cm) twin-wheel casters</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Vented back</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Removable drawers and plastic drawer liners</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 06 2024 14:33:08 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
